  <item>
    <title>Vol.17 赛博清河，摄影调频｜对谈“如鲠在喉”的闫炜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a16e6277460cabdeb56c08b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a16e6277460cabdeb56c08b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 12:57:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期主题】</span></strong></p><p><span>熟悉他相机节目的朋友们应该对片头的BGM毫不陌生，本期我们和《赛博调频》的主播闫炜聚在了一起，聊了聊他一直以来的影像节目创作和最近的变化。</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【相关素材】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>近期各自最喜欢的相机：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>韩冲：Leica Monochrome + 50mm f/2（Rigid）</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nsS33mcjbVr9pGNv9kJIIAwsXJbO.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>刘小川：Pentax 67 + 105mm f/2.4</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nh-Xk8DfAKnBC35Sf84GKZTud4hY.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>闫炜：尼康ZR+Retina（雷丁娜）iiic 50mm/f2</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nqNnKsQkbZcmGfF9-3v4MuNhS_Nn.jpg"></figure><p></p><p><span>【</span><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong><span>】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">00:16:00</a> 近期各自最喜欢的相机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">00:30:33</a> 老相机的魅力，操作反人类，反而成了快乐源泉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3808">01:03:28</a> 当下的内容创作，有关标准、受众和情绪化</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4777">01:19:37</a> 每个细胞都在呼唤「线下真好」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5144">01:25:44</a> 不必完美，歪七扭八反而能创造奇迹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5792">01:36:32</a> 内容更新的哲学：随性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6321">01:45:21</a> 摄影的起点，拍你熟悉又有感触的东西</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7874">02:11:14</a> 创作终极目的，只需取悦自己</span><br></p><p><span>本期主播：韩冲、刘小川</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：闫炜《赛博调频》</span></p><p></p><p><span>欢迎在Apple Podcast 或小宇宙等客户端订阅《清河摄影部》，如果你喜欢我们的节目，欢迎把节目分享给你周围喜欢摄影的朋友们，这会对我们有很大的帮助～</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65d37c2f38b975347636eb43/lr1u4TWCmAwGbIQAUaUA-EX_hDYQ.m4a" length="147521810" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:32:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqqarYZqTVCx261bm7D4a5BzysVn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
