    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期恰逢教师节，祝天下老师节日快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在成都正好与好朋友皇甫晓亮闲聊一些关于当摄影老师的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 从画室到暗房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 摄影老师之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 摄影是可以顿悟的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 资深成都人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 摄影的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 感谢学生们</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站/小红书：皇甫晓亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>高校摄影教师、“皇大书”“皇马卦”制作人、拥有摄影画册1200余本</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhlun7_8llp04lYpkZO6TPLhJIcN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>皇甫晓亮的摄影书房：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvc6mz1tkHtYEmzMIsMjjfxo4QtF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【频道介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清河摄影部是由几位影像行业从业者发起的一档影像生活类杂谈音频节目，希望在灿烂的影像故事中穿梭，定格一些回忆，按下几声清脆的快门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>皇甫晓亮/韩冲/刘小川</span></p>]]></description>
