    <guid isPermaLink="false">66443eca82b428eafdb247fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 04:49:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>与青年摄影师、艺术家张容浩聊聊科班学摄影的二三事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：张容浩，青年摄影师，艺术家。毕业于麻省艺术设计学院。作品曾展出于三影堂摄影艺术中心，Griffin摄影博物馆，波士顿摄影资源中心等，刊登发表于《Musee》《艺术客》杂志等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> 为什么学摄影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a></span></strong><span> 聊聊毕业作品</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> </span></strong><span>之于工作：不要去美化你没走的那条路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> </span></strong><span>摄影科班毕业都会做摄影师么</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a> </span></strong><span>怎么看“业余”和“专业”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> </span></strong><span>Ins是个好的学习索引</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">58:50</a> </span></strong><span>爱好者怎么系统学摄影</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a> </span></strong><span>摄影如烹饪</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><span>与Alec Soth的偶遇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpBEfpKkDNXwIygiQeX_p0DidKVc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>部分毕业作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lliqrMYa4WaFOIyPcgGXnyhxBG5Z.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lji3ltuNOnk7izVoNOQF2433AW1-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljdzU1t19fof4loNb9Sx2JoDQRm7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrbslPOCmZFZDKYDa2faepug9Osl.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltuW3cEqipyfJyWRzMFgKQ-1dxMz.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrQN6p4wt1gQjeW95Mc99KwD4gHm.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【频道介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清河摄影部是由几位影像行业从业者发起的一档影像生活类杂谈音频节目，希望在灿烂的影像故事中穿梭，定格一些回忆，按下几声清脆的快门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张容浩/韩冲/刘小川</span></p>]]></description>
