  <item>
    <title>Vol.8 “硬要拍也能拍”｜对谈何脑斯：聊聊摄影开店与胶片摄影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66397e8f565d3f8fe32554fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66397e8f565d3f8fe32554fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 May 2024 01:06:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期与老朋友-当时照相馆主理人、资深商业人像摄影师何脑斯聊聊那些关于摄影开店和胶片摄影有关的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 何脑斯的摄影开店经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 从近期的出圈访谈视频聊起（点击观看：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Dp42117k3/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=af43b8bb62f94f71d69f641ee071c509" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Dp42117k3/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=af43b8bb62f94f71d69f641ee071c509"><span>上</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ep421R7Pd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=af43b8bb62f94f71d69f641ee071c509" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ep421R7Pd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=af43b8bb62f94f71d69f641ee071c509"><span>下</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 大爷的开店灵魂三连问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 基于“热爱”的职业选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 不去上班因为不想给别人添麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 客人多了一度是因为网红朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 怎么喜欢上胶片摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 支撑胶片冲扫业务的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3770">62:50</a> 胶片摄影与手机摄影的画质&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">69:00</a> 胶片的迷人在于“赋魅”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4700">78:20</a> 给新入门胶片摄影朋友的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/B站/微博：何脑斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq_csS4LZ9zyq71OY748IppBclzz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>何脑斯部分摄影作品：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqeQK_X8smZCDwY1ANT5FWMjm3ZV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>程璧2016年专辑《我想和你虚度时光》封面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigwpZCSxD-XmFO2HSxDKKW4f3RS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>爵士组合Mr.Miss《先生小姐》专辑封面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv6h8fuzq7-PglQ-o0kJGW3ARHRE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>音乐人陈鸿宇2019、2020年宣传照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlH-Z2kUTTwSNn1_OL9YHuiKVsI4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>痛仰乐队2016年宣传摄影</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmRW7e5lOYI6OKw3PSnn9UKzcqWf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【频道介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清河摄影部是由几位影像行业从业者发起的一档影像生活类杂谈音频节目，希望在灿烂的影像故事中穿梭，定格一些回忆，按下几声清脆的快门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>何脑斯/韩冲/刘小川</span></p>]]></description>
