    <guid isPermaLink="false">660cd0514f66d1c1dac3ef1c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Apr 2024 03:43:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>与老友自由摄影师、播客《禁止携带》主播李亚楠闲聊自由职业摄影师拍摄背后的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>欢迎亚楠 携带《禁止携带》串台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 自由摄影师的商业摄影之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 商业拍摄出行前的准备工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 给想尝试手机摄影的传统摄影师一点建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 传统相机摄影与手机摄影的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 浅聊创作瓶颈期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 关于“我拍我也行”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> 当代年轻人还喜欢摄影很可贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> 媒介还能给人提供想象空间么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">59:55</a> “感性”拍摄更“东方”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">01:04:00</a> 聊聊亚楠的相机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 下一步的拍摄计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4390">01:13:10</a> 聊聊公路旅行摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">01:21:00</a> “我是I人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5055">01:24:15</a> 聊聊获得</span><a href="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E5%8D%95%E5%90%91%E8%A1%97%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%97%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E5%A5%96%23" data-url="https://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E5%8D%95%E5%90%91%E8%A1%97%E4%B9%A6%E5%BA%97%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E5%A5%96%23"><span>“单向街书店文学奖</span></a><span>” 年度播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5190">01:26:30</a> 聊聊做摄影播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>【频道介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清河摄影部是由几位影像行业从业者发起的一档影像生活类杂谈音频节目，希望在灿烂的影像故事中穿梭，定格一些回忆，按下几声清脆的快门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>李亚楠/韩冲/刘小川</span></p>]]></description>
